Package: HMTL
Type: Package
Title: Heterogeneous Multi-Task Feature Learning
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: c(person("Yuan", "Zhong",role=c("aut","cre"),email = "aqua.zhong@gmail.com"), person("Wei","Xu",role = "aut"), person("Xin","Gao",role = "aut"))
Description: Fits heterogeneous multi-task learning models with regression,
    Huber and adaptive Huber regression, logistic regression, and exponential
    accelerated failure time tasks. The model uses a row-wise group-lasso
    penalty for common feature selection and can optionally use a within-task
    group similarity penalty. Information-criterion-based tuning and fitting
    diagnostics are also provided.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    Matrix,
    graphics,
    stats
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
